  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In projects upgraded from Unity 2019  to 2022, having any kind of mirror shader or Realtime ReflectionProbe active will crash the editor when compiling shaders OR switching to/from play mode. Also would crash in game when leaving the instance with a mirror active. Both SDK 3.5.0 and 3.5.1.\n\nI suspect this is a bug in Unity 2022.3.6f1 that has to do with the stereo processing. \n\n\"Failed to read magic number\" always in log file.\n\nI have not experienced this with a new Unity 2022 project yet.",
